text = [
    "  Welcome to the sector, operative. Your mission here is\n" +
    "straightforward, but the cost of failure is absolute: you\n" +
    "must descend into the depths to gather scrap from enemy\n" +
    "forces and use it to enhance your armor.",

    "  However, keep in mind: Everything Has a Price. Every\n" +
    "movement drains your suit's vital power, so stay vigilant.\n" +
    "You can recharge at designated energy terminals—such as\n" +
    "the one situated to the right of the tunnel simply by\n" +
    "pressing E.",

    "  Safety protocol warning: if your health or energy falls to\n" +
    "zero, system failure occurs. You will lose all gathered\n" +
    "scrap and be forcibly returned to base empty-handed.\n" +
    "Exercise caution and always return with as many resources\n" +
    "as you can carry.",

    "  Once back at the surface, use the console to the left of\n" +
    "the tunnel to upgrade your skills and push even further\n" +
    "into the unknown. But heed this warning: the deeper you\n" +
    "descend, the more lethal the threats awaiting you."
